<div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="page-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Pemeriksaan keaslian</span><h1>Verifikasi surat</h1></div><?php if (!$verification): ?><div class="alert alert-danger">Token tidak dikenal atau surat tidak lagi berlaku.</div><?php else: ?><section class="data-panel"><span class="status-pill <?= $verification['status'] === 'issued' ? 'success' : 'danger' ?>"><?= $verification['status'] === 'issued' ? 'Berlaku' : 'Tidak berlaku' ?></span><dl class="row mt-4 mb-0"><dt class="col-5">Jenis surat</dt><dd class="col-7"><?= e($verification['type_name']) ?></dd><dt class="col-5">Nomor register</dt><dd class="col-7"><?= e($verification['register_number']) ?></dd><dt class="col-5">Tanggal terbit</dt><dd class="col-7"><?= e($verification['issued_at'] ? date('d/m/Y', strtotime($verification['issued_at'])) : '—') ?></dd></dl><p class="small text-secondary mt-3 mb-0">Halaman verifikasi tidak menampilkan data pribadi pemohon. Gambar tanda tangan, bila digunakan, bukan tanda tangan elektronik tersertifikasi.</p></section><?php endif; ?></div></div></div>